dsh-anchored-standard-windows is an independent community Windows adaptation.

The preset is derived from dsh-anchored-standard:
  https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard
  commit f57a1bde2dbaba3039bdae8631f78a0cb3ae3ebe

The companion Windows runtime direction is derived from dsh-win32 0.3.0:
  https://github.com/sjh9714/dsh-win32
  commit f8a68a9836b84fdfec5c1f36ab60cea9923c689f

The composition adapts the DeepSeek Harness 0.1.0-rc.6 preset and Cordis APIs:
  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

